        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Maan guang the aniu kandi ringpui tingmik ,",
            "Neilapui tingmik ni manni the,",
            "Tingmik thui neila khang makge,",
            "Nuhlo , nang ring bam khou.",
            "",
            "Kandi cham pan zianmei ntam dat kansini,",
            "Neilana lung khat na suna;",
            "Heikandi ring mei dui sini,",
            "Poubaomei tan tandi kho.",
            "",
            "2. Zing bang zingmei lev kandi ryanra mei rui,",
            "Kalat ncham khang sukatuak ge;",
            "Alung gei mei su man lou o.",
            "Kapmei ti man lou o.",
            "",
            "3. Poubaomei nduang o njian mei guai le,",
            "Nang bam pui ram gaimei tei hou khang;",
            "Ntam mei hei naipu lak khe.",
            "Lung gei mei paeng thang tei.",
            "",
            "4. Kandi kapmei guai le ntam ping lak khe,",
            "Banchra nun guai bampui ram gaimei ;",
            "Lu tei suan na ruak tei gaina,",
            "Kagundai ting kao ram."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
